Visualizations — Licensing
Copyright (c) 2026 Cseperke Papp (Papp Cseperke EV)

This repository contains interactive visualizations. Different parts are
licensed differently, on purpose. Use whichever license matches the part
you are reusing.

1. CODE  — the reusable machinery:
   rendering engines, interaction logic, layout/animation code, build
   scripts, and other general-purpose source.
   License: MIT  —  see LICENSES/MIT.txt

2. CONTENT, DATA & DESIGN — the authored, curated work:
   the selection, arrangement and editing of data; written copy; color
   palettes; typography; and visual composition.
   License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   see LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt  ·  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

PRECEDENCE — most specific wins:
   a per-file header   overrides   a per-folder LICENSE   overrides   this file.
   Unless a folder or file states otherwise, the rule above applies across the
   whole repository, including visualization types added in the future.

ATTRIBUTION
   When reusing CONTENT, DATA or DESIGN under CC BY 4.0, credit as:
     "Cseperke Papp — https://pappcseperke.hu"
   and link to https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ .
   MIT-licensed code must retain the copyright and permission notice.

